    {
      "id": "59142225-0843-413c-85e3-556229392c1a",
      "type": "brief",
      "date": "2026-04-10T11:32:21.000Z",
      "title": "Investor sentiment improves as stock rises 21%",
      "body": "After last week's 21% share price gain to ₹165, the stock trades at a forward P/E ratio of 6x. Average forward P/E is 10x in the Media industry in India. Total loss to shareholders of 21% over the past three years.",
